WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,960
Take it if it's given to you

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:02,400
Just a mobile phone

3
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:09,380
Don't be silent and positive, thank you brother

4
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:12,910
This computer is pretty fast, of course

5
00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:21,740
It should have been changed a long time ago. Look at the little electricity. I'll go upstairs. Hello, brother.

6
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:24,500
Is Lin Yu here?

7
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:26,500
