10
00:00:35,370 --> 00:00:39,380
He said he was looking for you to find out what happened to the two police officers.

11
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:40,900
This brand of coffee

12
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:41,900
Is it sold in your store?
